      "title": "Volatile txs garbage collected",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Rate of transaction bodies reaped from the volatile txs table by garbage collection, i.e. how fast tx storage is being reclaimed. A tx is reaped once no remaining volatile ebTxs row references it. Counts the txs table only -- the ebs and ebTxs eviction counts are separate metrics (leiosDbEvictedEbs, leiosDbEvictedEbTxs). Only advances when GC runs, so expect a sawtooth at the GC cadence; a sustained zero while the volatile txs gauge climbs means GC is not keeping up."
    },
