      "title": "Volatile txs copied to immutable",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Rate of transaction bodies copied from the volatile txs table into txs_imm by the copy to immutable, which runs once per cert-RB the ChainDB copier immutalises. Note \"copied\", not moved: the volatile original stays until no volatile EB references it, so this is not mirrored one-for-one by the eviction panel."
    },
